##### Seams + internal life (doctrine mechanics)

- `ledger.json`: every ordinary seam `cut-the-curve LEFT` (x, dir −1), exit
  and entry selectors = the inner `.swrap` wrappers (`#w-*`), NEVER the `#s-*`
